flowchart LR
    A[Choose representative cases] --> B[Run prompt version 1]
    B --> C[Run prompt version 2]
    C --> D[Score with the same criteria]
    D --> E[Compare improvements and regressions]
    E --> F{Improvement is reliable?}
    F -->|No| G[Revise one instruction]
    G --> B
    F -->|Yes| H[Keep version and monitor]